## 🔑 Key Environment Variables (optional)

Only set if you want cloud AI fallbacks (not needed for local AI):
```powershell
setx DEEPSEEK_API_KEY "..."
setx OPENAI_API_KEY "..."
setx ANTHROPIC_API_KEY "..."
setx GEMINI_API_KEY "..."
```

The system works **100% offline** without any of these.

